; matra: second. time is the apeksha (wrt) variable for mechanics.
; kramanusara in mechanics has apeksha=physics-time by default.
; in thermodynamics: apeksha=ushna (temperature). dS/dT, not dS/dt.
; in electromagnetism: apeksha=kshetra (position). E = -dV/dx.
; the apeksha is always explicitly declared on the kosha node; never assumed globally.

(kosha physics-time
  (abheda spanda-matra)
  (sthita kaala matra)
  (yukta kshetrajna velocity avrti)
  (vishesa kinematics-varga)
  (matra second))
